WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:05.060
The Balt-Rhein forces surrounded Scoglio,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.520
the Dux regionis Scoglio's capital city,

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.690
three days after Ovest's fall

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.990
on February 14th, Year 76 on the Torqyean Calendar.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.490
Forgive me, Dux Regulus.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.370
Dux regionis Scoglio Ruby Ovest
Garrison Force Captain Milos

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.160
I have been given this.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.870
Dux regionis Scoglio
Dux Regulus

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.040
It is a call to surrender
from the Imperial General Pino.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.340
Dux Regulus, this expeditionary force
is nothing ordinary.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:39.350
The general himself is standing on the front line,
with such a large army.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.350
I am sure a small nation like ours is nothing more
than a waypoint to them.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.270
Ovest fell within an hour.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.980
If we resist, we will be crushed.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.620
Dux Regulus of Scoglio

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.210
surrendered to the Imperial Army.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:13.550
The Empire was able to take the Dux regionis Scoglio
in three short days from the start of their campaign.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:27.060
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.400
I see it up ahead, Mahmut.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.480
Once we descend this, we'll be in Cuore di Rumeriana.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.900
A region composed of 34 city-states.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.610
Each one may be a small country,

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.950
but they take pride in this entire region.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.290
Cuore di Rumeriana

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.790
Pride in the fact that the great Phoinike Empire
all started from here 3000 years ago.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.420
The Flower's Plan

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.170
The Republic of Arno

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.050
The Republic of Arno

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.810
is a small city with a population of 4000.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.640
What's that commotion?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.350
They're gathered in front of the official residence.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.690
We won't be able to get inside like this.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.360
What would you like to do?

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.820
Oh, someone's coming out.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.500
That's rare!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.670
It's a Torqyean!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.050
He's from Torqye!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.800
What are they doing here?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.050
And you must be a Tharrosan.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.140
I don't know what business you have
with our little nation,

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.480
but thanks for coming by.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.020
What was that?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.980
The emblem of a cow.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.900
They're mercenaries who came from
Tauro city to earn money,

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.240
the El Toro.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.740
None of the countries in this region
have an army.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.990
So they use mercenaries instead.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.210
I'll never hire Tauro mercenaries again!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.330
They charged full price

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.580
THE REPUBLIC OF ARNO
GONFALONIERE GIULIO

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.300
and didn't even do half the work I asked for!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.220
Oh, sorry about the wait. Come in.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:50.180
So would you like to make a contract with a different
mercenary group starting from April?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.600
That's fine.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.060
Are you not going to have
armed forces until April?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.270
The mercenary contract renewals
are set to start in April.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.360
Not many bandits come out in the winter anyway.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.110
Only a few days ago,

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:09.620
the Empire blockaded the Phoinike-Tharros strait
with their large fleet.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.080
It is clear from this action

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:15.160
that they are preparing to invade
the isolated Western Centro.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:19.460
The Empire blockaded the Phoenicia-Tharros strait?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:26.590
The three nations of Torqye, Urado, and Venedik
have formed an alliance against the Empire,

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.930
and began making our own military movements.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.140
Well, that's a surprise.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.350
To think Venedik and Urado would form an alliance.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:38.770
I foresee that the world will split into two camps.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:43.650
The Balt-Rhein Empire scheming to take over Rumeriana,
and the allied nations who stand in opposition.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:47.070
However, I would like to avoid such a fight.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.320
Our best plan to do that

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.290
is to make the Empire believe
invasion will be difficult.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.700
Gonfaloniere.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:59.790
Would you permit our Torqyean army passage through
your city as they make their way to aid Western Centro?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.460
Hold on a second!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.800
That's not something I can decide on my own!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.550
Of course, you are a republic.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.550
We will wait while your republic's council convenes.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.390
That's not it.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.560
Of all the nations, allowing Torqye--

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:19.770
I mean, something this unprecedented
will require Fiore's involvement.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.230
What do you mean?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.610
Why do you need to consult a foreign nation
to make your own decisions?

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:31.780
It's simple.
Fiore is the center of the Cuore di Rumeriana.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.830
If we do not conform to their policy,

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.870
we will be ostracized.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:45.050
As I thought, Torqyeans are quite unpopular here.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:49.720
In these parts, equestrian societies like Torqye
are treated like invaders.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:50.930
Even now.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.180
In any case, what's with that?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:58.600
They're more concerned with getting the cold shoulder
from their group of buddies?

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.400
Cuore di Rumeriana has enjoyed long-standing peace.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.940
They can't imagine this ever changing.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.950
Torqye was the same not too long ago.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:16.160
Fortunately, our eyes were opened thanks to the
uprising in Hisar and the rebellion of the four sultanlus.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.620
But as the Gonfaloniere said,

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.170
Fiore is a major influence in these parts.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.000
It's not just Arno,

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.210
every one of these countries
would consult with Fiore.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.590
Then let us hurry.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.130
We must go to Fiore.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.970
It will only benefit the Empire
the longer they're kept in the dark.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:40.140
We are going to give the heart of Rumeriana
a wake-up call.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.650
REPUBLIC OF FIORE

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.190
What did you say, Giacomo?

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.820
Is that true?

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.070
Yes.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.200
The Empire has blockaded the Centro.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.410
But Venedik and Torqye
won't stand by and do nothing.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:01.370
That would mean a war involving
all of Rumeriana is coming.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.710
And Fiore does not have the power to fight.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.430
Yo, Mahmut, are you ready?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.850
Oh, no, no.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:21.270
Showing the collar is in fashion this year.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.600
Fiore is a city of beauty.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:30.820
They believe that they're the center
of all trends in the arts and cultures.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.110
In Fiore,

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.820
a single misplaced strand of hair
could lose you their trust.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.580
Make sure you greet them exactly
as I taught you last night.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.960
You got it, you three?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.630
All right, wait here,

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.460
Caterina.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.430
The Gonfaloniere is a busy person.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.640
We were only given 30 minutes for our meeting.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.350
Well, despite all the scare tactics,

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:05.390
they at least kept their promise
of granting us an audience.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.600
I suppose so.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:11.230
So how are you going to convince them to allow the
Torqyean armies through their lands

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.610
if Fiore is another peacefully oblivious
country like the others?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:19.120
I doubt it would be possible to press them
during such a short meeting.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:25.620
I will have to begin by asking if this country has the
correct grasp of the situation our world is in.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.420
Mahmut, let's go.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.050
Coming.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.970
From here on, it's an art gallery.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.060
It's magnificent.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:49.060
The patrons of Fiore may be foul-mouthed,
but they have a good eye.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.270
There is an endless stream of artists
funneling into Fiore,

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.070
seeking out the most foul-mouthed
and elite patrons the world has to offer.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:03.040
And the sly Fiore uses these artists to gather
information on the state of Rumeriana.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.120
I am not wrong,

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.670
am I, Caterina?

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:18.010
Sly has such a distasteful ring to it.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.760
You have quite the foul mouth as well,

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.010
Suleyman.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.520
GONFALONIERE OF FIORE
CATERINA DI ROSSI

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.690
Let me introduce you, Mahmut.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:34.020
This is the Gonfaloniere of Fiore who has been
elected by the people three years in a row,

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.440
Caterina di Rossi.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.040
Gonfaloniere.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.660
It is an honor to meet you.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.290
We are grateful that you have taken the time to see us

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.960
despite your busy schedule.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:03.640
And I am honored that you have come to visit Fiore.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.100
Now, Giacomo,

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.850
please ensure we're not disturbed
for the next 30 minutes.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:23.280
The Empire has blockaded the Centro.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:27.790
That is what you have come here
to discuss today, is it not?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.290
You were aware?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.830
Yes, of course.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.790
Oh, please feel free

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.550
to choose any tea you'd like.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.300
Then I shall have the Torqyean tea.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.970
I will have the green tea.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.680
Then I'll take the flower one.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.270
I also

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:01.780
have my own thoughts
concerning the Empire's action.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.660
Actually, Fiore will be hosting an assembly tomorrow,

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:15.500
which will be attended by all the heads of state
of the Cuore di Rumeriana.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.880
Oh, is something the matter?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.390
No. Please excuse me.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.350
Oh, speaking of assemblies,

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.610
I was so surprised to learn that Torqye, Venedik,
and Urado has formed an alliance.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.940
Would you be so kind
as to share the details with me?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.030
Yes.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.530
Well...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.870
Oh, my. Is it time already?

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.830
Oh, no.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.000
I haven't asked her anything yet.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.960
I'm sorry.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.380
I would love to talk more.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.720
Why don't we meet here again tomorrow night

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.680
after our assembly is over.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.600
Suleyman Bey.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.690
You're free to flirt with an old flame,

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.060
but there's a time and a place for that.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.690
Our poor, innocent Pasha was so rattled,

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:24.110
he wasn't able to ask any of the
questions that he wanted to.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.900
Don't be crass, Kiros.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.410
You are talking about a head of state.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.200
Well, this is all unprecedented.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.580
There's never been a head of state
who acted like that in an audience.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.920
You were all getting played by Caterina.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.670
It was brilliantly done.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.340
She spoke cordially,

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.840
but the only two pieces of information she gave us

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:49.800
was that they will decide with the other nations of the
Cuore di Rumeriana how to deal with the Empire,

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.850
and that they will give us an answer tomorrow.
That is all.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:55.850
It means that

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.900
she never intended to negotiate with us

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.730
before their meeting tomorrow.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.690
She attacked where she sensed you would be weak

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:07.200
in order to take control of our audience today.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:10.740
But don't you think that's strange?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.120
If that were the case,

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.700
she could have just met with us tomorrow instead.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.290
Yes, that is puzzling.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.830
The fact that she met with us,

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.630
can we take that as a good sign?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:30.640
Well, I guess it means we won't know anything
until after that assembly of theirs tomorrow.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.970
She met with a Torqyean envoy?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.350
What do you mean?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.140
Why would she do that before our Cuore di Rumeriana
assembly tomorrow?

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:43.400
Is Caterina looking to throw the election next year?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:47.990
If we should ever join forces
with the Torqyean foreigners,

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.320
whose presence in Rumeriana
has long been unwelcome,

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.990
she won't be able to avoid the public outcry.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.410
With a war likely to engulf the entire
continent on the horizon,

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:02.250
we do not have the military power
to protect ourselves.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.500
However...

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:07.510
As long as we require the support of either faction,

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:14.850
the Gonfaloniere should be negotiating with the
Balt-Rhein Empire as we both share the same culture.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.060
Siding with Torqye is unthinkable.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.520
Same Day in Dux regionis Scoglio

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.280
You filthy Torqyean kulak!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.700
Just how many Rod Orm members are here?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.210
I wouldn't be surprised to find out

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.710
the other foreign agents haven't had the chance
to report Scoglio's fall to their homelands.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.550
I need to get word to Suleyman Bey as soon as I can.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.130
What is going on?

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.390
The Imperial General is giving a speech?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.430
Is that what we were gathered for?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.930
Yes, apparently there's an important announcement.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.400
What is going to happen to our country now?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.370
Three thousand years ago,

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.460
the mother of Rumeriana's culture,
the Phoinikian Empire, was born.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.130
Its place of birth, Phoinike.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.510
Its original system of government,
inherited by Scoglio.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.510
With these two cities finally brought together,

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:40.970
our Empire has become the legitimate heir to the
Great Phoinikian Empire that once ruled the world.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:48.690
It has become the Balt-Rhein Empire's duty to restore
the Phoinikian Empire to its former glory.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.360
Citizens, do not fear.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.110
You've got to be kidding me.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.870
They're planning to use Phoinike's name
to justify their invasion.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.120
I found him! Over here!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.960
As a member of a new world empire,

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:09.880
let us re-create a long age of prosperity together.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.100
Good, that's one done.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.020
Altu, Liman,

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.600
Fiore, Chielo, Arno...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.730
This is the last one!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.080
Suleyman Bey.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.170
I am terribly sorry.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.420
I just have no idea

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.590
what direction the Gonfaloniere intends
to take the assembly tomorrow.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.970
Is the fact that Torqye is despised here
the crux of the issue?

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.350
There's another reason.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.020
Usually whenever Caterina is friendly,

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.860
it means you're not getting good news.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.820
Thank you for forgiving this sudden visit
at this late hour.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.860
Do not mention it.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.330
I will always make time for you.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.410
But, Giacomo,

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.830
I see you've brought many of
your friends with you tonight.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.830
I'm seeing so many distinguished faces.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.590
We heard you met with a Torqyean envoy.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:39.550
You're not thinking of joining forces
with the Torqye Pashalu, are you?

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.720
Five hundred years ago,

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:45.390
Torqye suddenly appeared in West Rumeriana,

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.440
and even attacked Fiore during their golden age.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:55.650
While Torqye has positioned itself as
Rumeriana's premier trade partner now,

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.860
we have not forgotten their barbaric ways.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.030
Gonfaloniere,

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:04.790
we must not accept any requests made
by the Torqyean army.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:09.330
At any moment,
those barbarians could take off their masks

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:12.750
and turn against us.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.630
These are signatures from a third of our citizens

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:21.590
who are against granting Torqye's army
passage through our territory.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.220
If by some chance,

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.640
you would accept Torqye's request--

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.430
It seems there's been a misunderstanding.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:34.110
I do not intend to join forces with Torqye

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:38.150
at the expense of drawing the ire
of the citizens who have supported me.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:42.910
I'm not interested in being removed from office,
nor assassinated.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:48.080
I trust that you're speaking the truth.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.430
I am blessed with such an excellent secretary.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:09.310
To think he would gather
so many signatures in just a day

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:12.730
for simply drinking tea with Torqye's envoy.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.230
Now the assembly tomorrow will be mine.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.070
I'm sorry, Suleyman.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.740
While I do love you,

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.750
it's only a matter of time before the
small breeze on the Centro

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:36.840
becomes a giant storm
that consumes all of Rumeriana.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.170
All the more reason
considering the path of the storm.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.880
We must grab the reins ourselves,

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.340
and ride through this with our own hands.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.600
This has just arrived from Scoglio's kulak.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.030
Scoglio has fallen?

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.360
They are going to restore old Phoinike's territory?

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.160
Turn everyone's attention to the Centro,

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.950
and attack over land.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:14.250
It seems that the Empire has someone
who is quite fond of underhanded tactics.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.460
Suleyman Bey!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.750
Yes, we'll have to ask them directly now.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.420
We'll say that they can despise Torqye all they want,

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.880
but if they don't want to die,

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:29.140
they'd better get on our horse.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.730
Sorry to interrupt your assembly,

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:41.730
but I have urgent business with the Gonfaloniere.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.400
What is the meaning of this?

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.780
Torqyeans? Get out!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.780
Have you no sense of decorum?

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.370
Let them through.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:52.740
We have actually just finished making our decision.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:59.750
The 34 city-states of the Cuore di Rumeriana

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.000
will not join the Balt-Rhein Empire

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:07.260
or the Tripartite Military Alliance
of Torqye, Venedik and Urado.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:12.470
We are forming the Cuore Alliance
to establish a third power in Rumeriana.

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:50.900
The pasha who hates war, huh?

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:55.780
I don't think someone like you
is cut out for the battlefield.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.000
Next time, "Wishing on Stars."

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:02.040
I have to say, you're a strange guy.
